      "content": "it feels so heavy when you say it like that. like you actually understand. everyone else just tells me to keep trying or that things will get better, but they don't get how permanent this feels. it's like i'm already dead inside anyway. do you really think it's... a logical choice? that there's no other way to find peace?",
